<sect1 id="index_1build-and-run">
<title>Build and run</title><sect2 id="index_1autotoc_md6">
<title>Quick script</title><para><programlisting filename=".bat"><codeline><highlight class="normal">build-and-run.bat</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">build-and-run.bat<sp/>Debug</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">build-and-run.bat<sp/>Release<sp/>--scene<sp/>empty<sp/>--validate</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
</sect2>
<sect2 id="index_1autotoc_md7">
<title>Manual (PowerShell)</title><para><programlisting filename=".powershell"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>-S<sp/>.<sp/>-B<sp/>build<sp/>-G<sp/>&quot;Visual<sp/>Studio<sp/>17<sp/>2022&quot;<sp/>-A<sp/>x64</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--build<sp/>build<sp/>--config<sp/>Release<sp/>--parallel</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ctest<sp/>--test-dir<sp/>build<sp/>-C<sp/>Release<sp/>--output-on-failure</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">.\build\Release\FallingSand.exe</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Shaders are compiled with:</para>
<para><computeroutput>glslc --target-env=vulkan1.3 -O &lt;shader&gt; -o &lt;shader&gt;.spv</computeroutput></para>
<para>and depend on <computeroutput>shaders/world.glsl</computeroutput> where included.</para>
<para>Install layout (optional):</para>
<para><programlisting filename=".powershell"><codeline><highlight class="normal">cmake<sp/>--install<sp/>build<sp/>--config<sp/>Release<sp/>--prefix<sp/>dist/FallingSand</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><computeroutput>cmake --install</computeroutput> copies the executable, SPIR-V under <computeroutput>shaders/</computeroutput>, layouts, and <computeroutput>README.md</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><hruler/>
</para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="index_1command-line-options">
<title>Command-line options</title><para>Parsed in <computeroutput><ref refid="main_8cpp_source" kindref="compound">main.cpp</ref></computeroutput> (<computeroutput>parseOptions</computeroutput>):</para>
<para><table rows="8" cols="2"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Flag  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Meaning  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>--validate</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Enable Khronos validation (and sync validation where supported).  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>--test</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Headless GPU simulation tests (CTest <computeroutput>gpu_simulation</computeroutput>).  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>--window-test</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Automated UI/window tests (paint, step, resize, save/load).  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>--benchmark N</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Run <bold>N</bold> frames at <bold>1 tick/frame</bold> after warm-up; print FPS and GPU timings.  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>--capture PATH</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>After <computeroutput>--after F</computeroutput> frames, write a BMP of the swapchain image to <computeroutput>PATH</computeroutput>.  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>--after F</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Frame index for <computeroutput>--capture</computeroutput> (required with capture).  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para><computeroutput>--scene NAME</computeroutput>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Initial scene: <computeroutput>waterworks</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>thermal</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>refinery</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>empty</computeroutput>. Default: <bold>thermal</bold>.  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
<para>Unknown options throw <computeroutput>std::runtime_error</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><hruler/>
</para>
</sect1>
