<sect2 id="index_1autotoc_md12">
<title>HUD structure (<computeroutput>makeLayout</computeroutput> / <computeroutput>composeUi</computeroutput>)</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Canvas</bold> — letterboxed region mapping client pixels to world coordinates (<computeroutput>Layout::worldPoint</computeroutput>).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Panel</bold> — material swatches and scene tabs.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Footer</bold> — play/pause, step, reset, save/load, tool cycle, brush size track.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Cog</bold> — settings while running; in pause menu, settings for resolution presets (1280×800 … 2560×1440).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Status line</bold> — short messages after save/load/errors.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>Tooltip</bold> — hovering the canvas probes GPU cell and shows dominant material.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>UI geometry is rebuilt each frame from window size; draw records are up to <bold><computeroutput>maxQuads</computeroutput> (16384)</bold> <computeroutput>Quad</computeroutput> structs (32 bytes, <computeroutput>alignas(16)</computeroutput>) uploaded to a per-frame storage buffer.</para>
<para><hruler/>
</para>
</sect2>
</sect1>
